# Frontend Environment Variables for Production

# API Endpoint
# Replace with your Railway backend URL
REACT_APP_API_URL=https://frontend-dacn-production.up.railway.app/api

# Example values:
# REACT_APP_API_URL=https://employee-api.up.railway.app/api
# REACT_APP_API_URL=https://your-api-name-prod.herokuapp.com/api

# ========================================
# 🚀 Vercel Deployment Instructions
# ========================================

# 1. In Vercel Dashboard:
#    - Select your Frontend project
#    - Go to Settings → Environment Variables

# 2. Add this variable:
#    - Name: REACT_APP_API_URL
#    - Value: Your Railway backend URL + /api
#    - Environments: Production, Preview, Development

# 3. After adding variable:
#    - Go to Deployments tab
#    - Click "Redeploy" on latest deployment
#    - Wait 1-2 minutes for deployment

# 4. Test the app:
#    - Open your Vercel URL
#    - Try to login with admin/admin123
#    - Check DevTools Console (F12) for any CORS errors

# ========================================
# Note: Make sure backend CORS is configured to allow
# your Vercel domain in Backend-dacn/src/index.js
# ========================================
